        {
          "text": " “Arai kediaka tuŋanan, aibucar kaneejai EJAKAIT, aiŋal ekeidunyet kakirot naka aiŋad, arai naka etitiŋoi, arai naka aiŋat, arai aŋarunit ekeidunyet; ",
