        {
          "text": " Arai kedum ŋesi yenaoliorit, kiŋalaŋal, kiyapo nuka aisab; arai kiswama ituŋanan adiopet kaŋun kere, ediakarit kwaŋin: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
