              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iswamaun kakinyet, kotoma akeit; naebauniata itolomari kes: iinakini ainakinet naka akiria ikamoŋon lukeon araun asakat naeuru saa mama ejai EJAKAIT, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
