              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Esasedoti loinyonyoikinitai akinyet aiboisike lokodweke ŋes einanakini: icweeneno cut mama ejai EJAKAIT kokisil loka ikar kere. ",
          "type": "text",
