        {
          "text": " “Kolimok Aaron ka odweke ebe, Lo ŋes ekisil loka ainakinet naka adiakaret: kaibois nearakinio ainakinet naicweio, nepenen earakinio ainakinet naka adiakaret kakonyen nuka EJAKAIT: erai nakalaunan noi; ",
