        },
        {
          "text": " Yenetirori akiriŋike eraun yenikalaunan: ido naebwatanakinotor aokotoke anapito kere, ilosi ŋin naebwatakina kaibois nakalaunan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
